ucho</strong>, who always protects his people alongside his boyfriend, <strong>Nene</strong>. Together, they seek to banish the hostile <strong>demons </strong>that terrify the people and shatter their peace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These <strong>demons </strong>have existed for years; all of them are part of <strong>Xilas's</strong> team, she is the demon leader, it\u2019s a problem that needs to be solved;\u00a0<strong>Chucho</strong>\u00b4s goal is to save his people.</p>","developers":["Chispadev"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033420/bfe4338994c38f7da5ac51e721b6a26dfbcbc1e2/header.jpg?t=1764538360","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Chucho","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 160 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Chispadev"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Conte\u00fado sexual\nViol\u00eancia","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Sexuelle Andeutungen\nGewalt","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Coming soon"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033420/2aa249bcc7fe28042c45b86ee71d08b1b9ac8620/ss_2aa249bcc7fe28042c45b86ee71d08b1b9ac8620.1920x1080.jpg?t=1764538360","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033420/2aa249bcc7fe28042c45b86ee71d08b1b9ac8620/ss_2aa249bcc7fe28042c45b86ee71d08b1b9ac8620.600x338.j